{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04931","headline":"九月九日幸临渭亭登高应制得涘字 · 岑羲","name":"九月九日幸临渭亭登高应制得涘字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重九开科历，千龄逢圣纪。\n爰豫瞩秦垧，昇高临灞涘。\n玉醴浮仙菊，琼筵荐芳芷。\n一闻帝舜歌，欢娱良未已。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}